Chunk 1: Top Container

The Track Container (Stage Manager)
This is the physical window that determines when a slide is "Active."

TypeScript
// Scroll Physics
"snap-x snap-mandatory"

// Visibility & Overflow
"overflow-x-auto no-scrollbar"

// Interaction
"touch-pan-x"



The Slide Container
// Transition Properties
"duration-450 ease-in-out transition-all will-change-transform"

// Start State
"opacity-15"

// End State (Triggered by Carousel)
"group-data-[active=true]/slide:opacity-100"



Chunk 2: Bottom Consumers (Section & Links)

SECTION CONTAINER
// Transition Properties
"duration-300 delay-0 ease-in transition-[opacity,transform]"

// Start State
"translate-y-2 opacity-0"

// End State (Triggered by Carousel)
"group-data-[active=true]/slide:translate-y-0"
"group-data-[active=true]/slide:opacity-100"
"group-data-[active=true]/slide:delay-150"



LINKs CONTAINER
// Transition Properties
"duration-300 delay-0 ease-in transition-[opacity,transform]"

// Start State
"translate-y-2 opacity-0"

// End State (Triggered by Carousel)
"group-data-[active=true]/slide:translate-y-0"
"group-data-[active=true]/slide:opacity-100"

// Dynamic Stagger Logic
"group-data-[active=true]/slide:[transition-delay:calc(150ms+(var(--index)*100ms))]"



